perception-test-orb-default = A smooth orb, warm to the touch.
perception-test-orb-wizard = A seething knot of folded space, wearing the shape of an orb.
perception-test-orb-wizard-extra = It knows you can see it.
perception-test-shifting-a = It is a lamp.
perception-test-shifting-b = It is a very small door.
perception-test-shifting-c = It is somebody's lost memory.

